    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf1298b99bdf841cc63d28b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道她说的一样是指什么，但是……\n继续这样下去大概会吵起来。\n总之我得想办法介入调停──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f3b733a73e7da71d7486876d91e709046b9cbaf4f2fac31a8991a478df3259c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
