      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，不过各位来得正好！\n接下来正好要排演我牵起公主的手，\n跟海盗们战斗的场景！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd4e83514f2cf8a3a4450bbb4cd87f480c0216620a99abaeb0ef96f4ebc203c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
